{"games":[{"id":12805830692,"name":"IQ Obby","desc":"Do you have HIGH IQ?!?!!?\n\nTest your IQ AND SKILLS HERE AND OBTAIN SPECIAL GEARS FOR EACH OBBY YOU COMPLETE.\nthis game requires knowledge of roblox's popular glitches, \n\nBoth R6 and R15 are available depending on your avatar.\n\nIf you have earned a new badge, rejoin for it's item.\nAll your items will be in your backpack including game passes.\n\nThe higher the IQ, the higher the quality and appeal of the item.\nLow Quality Game (1,1)\n\n(Huge Update & Giveaway Coming Soon)","path":"/game/12805830692-iq-obby","slug":"12805830692-iq-obby","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/db102c021754fa48abb918f59b9a646eb0a06eacc96666885f41d79b78f1e784.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f785db1169e48e74c7d108d84883805f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":9,"visitor":23034762,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-05T22:29:48.682Z","creator":{"name":"Ncraft Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":18138547215,"name":"[RAIDS] Anime Card Battle","desc":"🌟Code: 70KLIKES!\n🌟Code: 80KLIKES!\n🌟Code: 50MVISITS!\n🌟Code: 100MVISITS!\n🌟Code: UPDATE9!\nNew Code at 90k Likes!\n\nWhat is Anime Card Battle?\nEmbark on a journey in this auto battle card game, where unique cards with powerful abilities clash in automated battles. Collect your cards and form parties to defeat bosses and players to claim victory!\n\n🎴Click the Roll button to open card packs. Get cards with cool Auras and strong abilities!\n⚗️You can drink potions to increase your luck.\n🍀Craft powerful charms to boost your luck!\n\nJoin our community to get announcements on updates!\nACB\n\nCredits: Hikari_Yami, D_avidd, TomDFresh, PepperDime, Draculaoji, DoctorDret, Mob, HamzaCaliph","path":"/game/18138547215-anime-card-battle","slug":"18138547215-anime-card-battle","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6cbb0f923cc535475c553b912c4656297d50a0fe31bc4974dcae69434a77b31e.webp","original":"https: